# Script library (an extension): the configuration screen's "script
# library folder" is where a script's import of a package the program
# doesn't have is read from. Set to a folder with the package gears, a
# script file run from the Script menu imports it.
twmove 217 202
twdown L 217 202
twup L 217 202
twmove 460 1415
twdown L 460 1415
twup L 460 1415
edit $testdata/ui/scriptlib/lib
tw
file $testdata/ui/scriptlib/gear.go
menu Script|Run File...
console
